<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#DBEAFE;border:1px solid #3B82F6;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Own entity, counts toward the minimum of 10 (rule 9). Tag C1–C14.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#FEF3C7;border:1px solid #D97706;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Kept from the starter, not counted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#F3F4F6;border:1px solid #9CA3AF;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Supporting entity: code list, settings or log. Not counted.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#FEF9C3;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; Column added to a starter entity (User.PharmacyId, issue #8).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#B45309'&gt;PK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; primary key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#1D4ED8'&gt;FK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; foreign key &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#7C3AED'&gt;UQ&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; unique index &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color='#7C3AED'&gt;U1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; columns of one composite unique index&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;?&lt;/b&gt; nullable column. datetime2 values are UTC; date columns are DateOnly.&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot notation: || exactly one, o| zero or one, |&amp;lt; one or many, o&amp;lt; zero or many. Dashed grey = reference from the StockMovement log.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lines to User are omitted for readability. Every column marked → User is a FK to User (CreatedBy, ReceivedBy, Pharmacist, RequestedBy, ApprovedBy, ShippedBy, AcknowledgedBy, UserId).&lt;br&gt;Starter auth tables (refresh tokens) are kept unchanged and not shown. Starter shop and Finance tables are deleted in #4." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#E5E7EB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="1202" width="860" height="406" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root>
</mxGraphModel>
